    "name": "EBANX FX Tokenization API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Retrieve current foreign exchange rates between local market currencies (BRL, MXN, COP, ARS, CLP, PEN, etc.) and pricing currencies (USD, EUR), and lock a rate via an FX token so a quoted price is honored at capture.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: EBANX Sales Engineering\n Email: sales.engineering@ebanx.com",
